#. module: device_machines
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:device_machines.field_device_machine_bucket__msg_count
msgid ""
"MQTT pings recorded once this hour started producing. The bucket opens on "
"the first reading that moves the counter, so pings received earlier in the "
"hour, while the machine was idle, are not counted. Use it as a sanity check:"
" few pings against a large count means readings went missing."
msgstr ""
"Pings MQTT registrados desde que esta hora empezó a producir. El bucket se "
"abre con la primera lectura que mueve el contador, así que los pings "
"recibidos antes en la hora, con la máquina parada, no se cuentan. Sirve como"
" verificación: pocos pings contra un conteo grande significa que se "
"perdieron lecturas."

